Value slot (\S+)
Value power_supply (\S+)
Value model (\S+)
Value power_supply_status (\S+)
Value output_watts ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value input_state (\S+)
Value output_state (\S+)
Value capacity_watts ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^${power_supply}\s+${model}\s+\S+\s+${power_supply_status}\s+\S+\s+\S+\s+${capacity_watts}/\d+\s*$$ -> Record
